# Two boxes on one line of sight, for the cut-plane pick E2E (Share#2131):
# an exterior wall at x 2.0..2.2 in front of an interior box at x -1..0,
# seen from +x. A Section cut at the model centre (x 0.6) removes the wall.
# The floor comes first and spans the model's whole x extent: the cut-plane
# menu centres a mesh model's cut on the first mesh's bounds, so the floor
# keeps that centre at x 0.6 too. It lies below the line of sight.
o Floor
v -1 -0.2 -1
v 2.2 -0.2 -1
v -1 0 -1
v 2.2 0 -1
v -1 -0.2 1
v 2.2 -0.2 1
v -1 0 1
v 2.2 0 1
f 1 3 4 2
f 5 6 8 7
f 1 2 6 5
f 3 7 8 4
f 1 5 7 3
f 2 4 8 6
o Exterior
v 2.0 0 -1
v 2.2 0 -1
v 2.0 2 -1
v 2.2 2 -1
v 2.0 0 1
v 2.2 0 1
v 2.0 2 1
v 2.2 2 1
f 9 11 12 10
f 13 14 16 15
f 9 10 14 13
f 11 15 16 12
f 9 13 15 11
f 10 12 16 14
o Interior
v -1 0.5 -0.5
v 0 0.5 -0.5
v -1 1.5 -0.5
v 0 1.5 -0.5
v -1 0.5 0.5
v 0 0.5 0.5
v -1 1.5 0.5
v 0 1.5 0.5
